# The Store installer is ~210 MB (WebView2 embedded). It is produced by
# `npm run store` and belongs on disk, never in git — the repo-wide *.exe rule
# already covers it, and this file says WHY for anyone who wonders where the
# binary went.
*.exe

# PRIVACY.md here is a COPY, refreshed from the repo root by the build. Editing
# this one is a mistake: it will be overwritten on the next `npm run store`.
# The source of truth is ../PRIVACY.md.
PRIVACY.md
